<section class="kf-about">
  <div class="kf-about-glow"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="kf-about-hero">
      <span class="kf-eyebrow">THE KITCHIFIX STORY</span>
      <h1>Thoughtful tools.<br><em>Beautifully simple.</em></h1>
      <p>We believe the best kitchen upgrades should feel effortless — useful every day, beautifully designed, and made to earn their place in your home.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="kf-story-grid">
      <div class="kf-story-card kf-featured">
        <span>01</span><h2>Designed for everyday life.</h2>
        <p>KitchiFix brings together smart kitchen essentials that solve small frustrations with elegant, practical design.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="kf-story-card"><span>02</span><h2>Less clutter. More ease.</h2><p>Every product is selected around a simple idea: make the things you do every day feel a little better.</p></div>
      <div class="kf-story-card"><span>03</span><h2>Quality without the noise.</h2><p>We focus on useful details, clean aesthetics and products that fit naturally into modern kitchens.</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="kf-values">
      <div><span class="kf-eyebrow">OUR STANDARD</span><h2>Small improvements.<br>Meaningful difference.</h2></div>
      <div class="kf-value-list"><div><b>01</b><strong>Useful by design</strong><p>No unnecessary complexity. Just products that make sense.</p></div><div><b>02</b><strong>Premium feel</strong><p>Clean presentation and considered details from screen to doorstep.</p></div><div><b>03</b><strong>Customer first</strong><p>A shopping experience built around clarity, trust and support.</p></div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="kf-about-cta"><span class="kf-eyebrow">WELCOME TO KITCHIFIX</span><h2>Your kitchen,<br><em>only better.</em></h2><a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="kf-btn">Explore the collection <span>→</span></a></div>
  </div>
</section>
